### Cria um novo usuário (precisa de autenticação de manager pra criar outros managers)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Dina",
    "password": "123"
}

### Login usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Dina",
    "password": "123",
    "accountType": "ADMIN"
}

